2c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v35.38c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-35.38c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 40.38c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-35.38c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path></g></svg></div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>The average amount of coffee dispensed into medium cups is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"590\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> ounces. Additionally, in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"591\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of cups, the coffee amount is less than <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"592\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9.1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> ounces. Assuming the amount dispensed is normally distributed, find the percentage of cups containing less than <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"593\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8.5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> ounces of coffee. <strong>Round your answer to two decimal places.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Hint: A table of values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"594\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> for different values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"595\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is given below, where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"596\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution.</em></p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"> \n<td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attache